<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - Queensland Cotton half yr profit up.</title>
<headline>RTRS - Queensland Cotton half yr profit up.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to August 31</p>
<p>		(millions A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			10.55 vs 6.32</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		 7.0  vs 5.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Queensland Cotton Holdings Ltd is one of Australia's largest processors and marketers of cotton.  </p>
<p>    Operating profit	  16.5 vs  10.34</p>
<p>    Sales		     268.31 vs 199.76</p>
<p>Dividend</p>
<p>Dividend 100 percent franked</p>
<p>Pay Nov 1</p>
<p>Reg Oct 28</p>
<p>    Tax			    6.10 vs  4.02</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		 42.1  vs 33.6</p>
<p>    Interest		     1.76 vs  3.29</p>
<p>    Depreciation		 5.07 vs  3.94</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 973-1800</p>
</text>
